      "details": "<p>Inscriptions from objects in the \"Berthouville treasure\" include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>DEO MERCVRIO KANETONNESSI = Deo Mercurio Kanetonnessi (sic)</li>\r\n<li>MERIO CANETO = Mer(cur)io Caneto(...?)</li>\r\n<li>DEO MERC CAN ... = Deo Merc(urio) Can(et...)</li>\r\n</ul>",
